#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:6
msgid "Compile, Flash and Run Your First Example"
msgstr "编译、烧录和运行第一个示例"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:8
msgid ""
"This guide walks you through compiling, flashing, and running the first "
"UniSDK example program — the GPIO demo (Blinky LED blinking)."
msgstr ""
"本指南将引导您完成第一个 UniSDK 示例程序——GPIO 演示（LED 闪烁）的编译、"
"烧录和运行。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:10
msgid "Select the First Example"
msgstr "选择第一个示例"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:12
msgid ""
"The recommended first example is **gpio_demo** (GPIO LED blinking). It "
"has the simplest logic (only peripheral initialization and a basic loop),"
" the fewest dependencies, and does not involve complex wireless protocol "
"stacks. This provides the shortest path to verify that your toolchain, "
"SDK configuration, and hardware connection (programmer to target board) "
"are all functioning correctly."
msgstr ""
"推荐的第一个示例是 **gpio_demo**（GPIO LED 闪烁）。它的逻辑最简单（仅含外设"
"初始化和基本循环），依赖项最少，且不涉及复杂的无线协议栈。这提供了最短路径来"
"验证您的工具链、SDK 配置和硬件连接（编程器到目标板）是否全部正常工作。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:14
msgid "Source code location: `samples/gpio_demo/main.c`"
msgstr "源代码位置：`samples/gpio_demo/main.c`"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:16
msgid "Build the Project"
msgstr "构建项目"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:18
msgid "VS Code Extension (Recommended)"
msgstr "VS Code 扩展（推荐）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:20
msgid "Step 1: Select the Source Directory"
msgstr "第 1 步：选择源目录"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:22
msgid ""
"In the **Telink DEVELOPMENT** view, click the **Source Directory** button"
" (or the folder icon) and choose the `samples/gpio_demo` directory."
msgstr ""
"在 **Telink DEVELOPMENT** 视图中，单击 **Source Directory** 按钮"
"（或文件夹图标），然后选择 `samples/gpio_demo` 目录。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:24
msgid "![Select Source Directory](pics/select_source_directory.png)"
msgstr "![选择源目录](pics/select_source_directory.png)"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:24
msgid "Select Source Directory"
msgstr "选择源目录"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:26
msgid "Step 2: Configure the Chip and Board"
msgstr "第 2 步：配置芯片和开发板"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:28
msgid ""
"Click the **tl-config** button to open the configuration interface. ![tl-"
"config](pics/tl_config.png)"
msgstr ""
"单击 **tl-config** 按钮打开配置界面。![tl-config](pics/tl_config.png)"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:28
msgid "tl-config"
msgstr "tl-config"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:30
msgid ""
"Select the target chip and board (for example, TLSR9528A / "
"TLSR9528A_EVK). ![Select Chip and Board](pics/select_chip_and_board.png)"
msgstr ""
"选择目标芯片和开发板（例如 TLSR9528A / TLSR9528A_EVK）。"
"![选择芯片和开发板](pics/select_chip_and_board.png)"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:30
msgid "Select Chip and Board"
msgstr "选择芯片和开发板"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:32
msgid "Configure build options. ![Build Options](pics/build_options.png)"
msgstr "配置构建选项。![构建选项](pics/build_options.png)"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:32
msgid "Build Options"
msgstr "构建选项"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:34
msgid ""
"Configure the pinmux (pin functions). Press **Q** to save and exit at "
"each step. ![Pinmux](pics/pinmux.png)"
msgstr ""
"配置 pinmux（引脚功能）。在每个步骤中按 **Q** 保存并退出。"
"![Pinmux](pics/pinmux.png)"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:34
msgid "Pinmux"
msgstr "Pinmux"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:39
msgid "Step 3: Build"
msgstr "第 3 步：构建"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:41
msgid ""
"Click **tl-build** to start the build. The build output appears in the "
"terminal panel."
msgstr ""
"单击 **tl-build** 开始构建。构建输出将显示在终端面板中。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:43
msgid ""
"After a successful build, the output files are generated in the `build/` "
"directory:"
msgstr ""
"构建成功后，输出文件将生成在 `build/` 目录中："

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md
msgid "Build Output Files"
msgstr "构建输出文件"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:56
msgid "CLI Approach (Alternative)"
msgstr "CLI 方式（备选）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:67
msgid "Flash the Firmware"
msgstr "烧录固件"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:69
msgid "Prerequisite: Connect the Hardware"
msgstr "前提条件：连接硬件"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:71
msgid "Connect the PC to the Telink programmer using a USB cable."
msgstr "使用 USB 线将 PC 连接到泰凌编程器。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:72
msgid "Connect the programmer to the target board using jumper wires:"
msgstr "使用杜邦线将编程器连接到目标板："

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:73
msgid "**Power**: VCC ↔ VCC, GND ↔ GND"
msgstr "**电源**：VCC ↔ VCC，GND ↔ GND"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:74
msgid "**Data**: SWM (Programmer) ↔ SWS (Target board)"
msgstr "**数据**：SWM（编程器）↔ SWS（目标板）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:76
msgid "Flash via BDT (CLI)"
msgstr "通过 BDT（命令行）烧录"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:82
msgid "To specify a flash address:"
msgstr "指定烧录地址："

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:88
msgid ""
"For GUI-based flashing instructions, refer to the [BDT Tool "
"Guide](../tools/bdt.md)."
msgstr ""
"有关基于 GUI 的烧录说明，请参阅 [BDT 工具指南](../tools/bdt.md)。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:90
msgid "Flash via JTAG"
msgstr "通过 JTAG 烧录"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:92
msgid ""
"JTAG flashing requires the ICEman backend service. For detailed "
"instructions, refer to the [Development Guide](../developing/index.md)."
msgstr ""
"JTAG 烧录需要 ICEman 后端服务。有关详细说明，请参阅"
"[开发指南](../developing/index.md)。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:94
msgid "Verify the Result"
msgstr "验证结果"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:96
msgid "After flashing is complete:"
msgstr "烧录完成后："

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:98
msgid ""
"The development board resets automatically (or press the **Reset** button"
" manually)."
msgstr ""
"开发板会自动复位（或者手动按下 **Reset** 按钮）。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:99
msgid "Observe the on-board LED — it should blink at a fixed interval."
msgstr "观察板载 LED——它应该以固定间隔闪烁。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:100
msgid "(Optional) Connect a serial terminal to view debug log output."
msgstr "（可选）连接串口终端查看调试日志输出。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:102
msgid ""
"**Expected Result**: The on-board LED blinks periodically, indicating "
"that the application is running successfully on the target chip."
msgstr ""
"**预期结果**：板载 LED 周期性闪烁，表明应用程序已在目标芯片上成功运行。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:104
msgid "Next Steps"
msgstr "下一步"

#: ../../source/getting_started/first_example.md:106
msgid ""
"Congratulations on successfully running your first UniSDK program! "
"Continue exploring:"
msgstr ""
"恭喜您成功运行了第一个 UniSDK 程序！继续探索："

